+// visionOS VR variant (VISIONOS_VR): view distance from a reverse-Z depth with an infinite far
+// plane (depth = near / distance). near is in world units, so the result is in world units.
+// Depth 0 (nothing drawn) becomes a very large finite distance instead of infinity or NaN.
+float ViewDistanceReverseZ(float depth, float near)
+{
+	return near / max(depth, 1e-7);
